# FmrbHitMask.new

new(Integer width, Integer height, String bits, ?Integer scale) -> FmrbHitMask

Make a mask (bits row by row)

width x height cells. bits: (width + 7) / 8 bytes per row, the leftmost
cell in the top bit. A set cell is hit.
